    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darktopia</strong> is a rogue-lite game with turn-based battles and RPG elements. Embark on an epic journey through a dark utopian world, where corruption spreads like a plague, and every decision could mean the difference between survival and doom. Protect your team from the ever-corrupting infection while uncovering the secrets of this mysterious dystopia. <br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25aa Shared Battlefield</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your heroes strategically within enemy lines to turn their own attacks against them with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>\u25aa Turn-Based Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize your actions in tactical, turn-based battles.<br><br><strong>\u25aa Dark Utopian Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a beautiful pixel-art world filled with haunting landscapes, futuristic ruins, and oppressive shadows. <br><br><strong>\u25aa Corruption Mechanic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance risk and reward as the infection threatens to consume your team. How far will you go to achieve your mission? </p>",
